.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", focusing its malicious intent on a certain area.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["[",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"]"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One designated area within 12 squares of you, and within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," All squares within the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," are filled with driving acid rain that provides ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"},", and deals 2d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acid"}," damage to any creature that enters the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]},", or begins its turn within the area. The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," also imposes a -5 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks to listen, as the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," howls loudly. The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," lasts until the end of your next turn. This is an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Area Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Area_Attack"},". The result of the check determines the effect, if any:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["DC\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EFFECT\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You create a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," that covers a 3x3 square area. At least one square within that area must be within the given range of this Force Power.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You create a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," that covers a 4x4 square area. At least one square within that area must be within the given range of this Force Power.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["30\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You create a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," that covers a 5x5 square area. At least one square within that area must be within the given range of this Force Power.\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["35\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["You create a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," that covers a 6x6 square area. At least one square within that area must be within the given range of this Force Power.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to increase the damage dealt by the acid rain by an additional +2d6 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acid"}," damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can maintain ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]}," from round to round, extending the normal duration. Maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm "]},{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", and you must make a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check each round. If you take damage while maintaining ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]},", you must succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check (DC = 15 + damage taken) to continue maintaining the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Force Storm"]},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
